1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,480
I killed Chung B.

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,600
No, I killed Chung.

3
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,480
Arrest me. Go ahead...

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,280
Grandma, I love you.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,920
Yes, I need a car,

6
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,560
from Ko Cho Village to Wan Mei Village.

7
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:45,680
My wife didn't kill Chung B. I did.

8
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,200
What? Why did you do it?

9
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:52,240
Chi, why are you saying this?

10
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,840
We'll take Cheung Wang-chi's statement

11
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,160
in the presence of a social worker.

12
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:58,240
You must all go back to the Police station

13
00:00:58,360 --> 00:00:59,120
for yours.

14
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:09,280
The cops are downstairs.

15
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,880
They'll bring me in for questioning.

16
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:16,480
Remember what I told you before?

17
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,680
If the Police ask you something
you can't answer,

18
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:20,120
what should you do?

19
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,760
Say nothing.

20
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:22,760
Good.

21
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:26,760
Just do what I told you to do.

22
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:28,400
When you get to the Police station,

23
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:30,560
first you make a scene

24
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,240
then complain about chest pain

25
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:33,760
and ask to be sent to the hospital.

26
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:36,160
Once you get there, just tell them
you want to see me alone.

27
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:39,840
Chi, the Police found out

28
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,600
we went to Chung's village house.

29
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:44,240
We can't hide anymore.

30
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:48,960
You don't want to see me and
the baby go to jail, right?

31
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,880
It's time you tell the Police

32
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,600
what I told you before.

33
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:58,080
I must protect you.

34
00:01:58,520 --> 00:02:05,280
I want Chung B to reincarnate

35
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:07,440
and be our son again.

36
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,560
I have taught him for so long,

37
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:12,160
Chi should know what to tell the Police.

38
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:15,760
The Police should believe Chi hated Chung

39
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:18,720
and wanted to kill this illegitimate son.

40
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:26,480
One day, Chung B called me and told me...

41
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:34,560
no, I told him I wanted to see him.

42
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:39,160
He gave me the address

43
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:42,960
so I took a taxi there with my wife.

44
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:48,880
Inside, we had a fight.

45
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:53,600
my wife was so pissed, she left.

46
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:58,000
I was angry he pissed off his mother.

47
00:02:58,240 --> 00:03:00,720
I told him he was an illegitimate child

48
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:04,720
and should have no claim on
my father's assets.

49
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:10,840
He was so angry that I didn't believe him

50
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:14,880
he had a seizure.

51
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:21,440
I saw a sugarcane and wanted to save him.

52
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:27,600
I stuck it down his mouth

53
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:29,920
so he won't bite his tongue.

54
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:34,560
But he hit me

55
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:40,720
and flung his arms and legs around.

56
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:45,920
I forced the sugarcane in further

57
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:51,040
and after a while he died.

58
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,440
Then what happened?

59
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:57,040
My wife came back inside.

60
00:03:57,480 --> 00:04:01,840
How come Chung B is not moving?

61
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,760
He's dead.

62
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:07,000
My wife knew I killed Chung B by mistake

63
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:10,160
and didn't want me to go to jail.

64
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:13,680
The bag had my fingerprints on it,

65
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,760
we must remove it.

66
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:20,640
We also took the bag with the papers
dividing up the money.

67
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:23,240
After we packed everything...

68
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,000
Let's go.

69
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:30,160
we flagged down a taxi nearby and paid cash.

70
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:34,000
We went home and pretended

71
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:35,280
we never went out.

72
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:36,960
That's all.

73
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:40,800
Why didn't you tell us sooner?

74
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:43,920
I don't want my wife to go to jail.

75
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:45,840
Didn't you complain about chest pain?

76
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:48,800
You seem fine as soon as your wife shows up.

77
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,320
Why did you suddenly turn yourself in?

78
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,240
Did your wife tell you in the room

79
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,600
to take the rap for her?

80
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:56,560
No! I killed Chung B!

81
00:04:56,760 --> 00:05:00,080
I did...I killed Chung B!

82
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:02,400
It wasn't her fault.

83
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,480
Relax...

84
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:07,040
Did your wife tell you to put

85
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:09,760
Chung Siu-chung's smart watch
in your mother's bedroom?

86
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:10,840
No.

87
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:17,120
I didn't want Mom to regret throwing away
Chung's belonging.

88
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:23,920
Also...I put the jacket in Mom's room.

89
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:26,800
Not my wife.

90
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:31,520
My husband has the mental age
of an 8-year-old.

91
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:34,000
He didn't mean to kill Chung.

92
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:36,640
I'm his wife, I can't tell on him

93
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:37,840
and let him go to jail.

94
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:40,400
You knew Cheung Wang-chi was
connected to Cheung Siu-chung's death,

95
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:43,520
why did you tell the Police
Tang Suk-han is a suspect

96
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:45,200
and made us look for her jacket?

97
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:50,320
I only found out later she was
at the village house.

98
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:53,360
I never got along with my mother-in-law.

99
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,520
I'd rather you arrest her.

100
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:57,280
I must protect my husband.

101
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:59,120
Where is the second trust fund document?

102
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:00,480
I burnt it.

103
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:04,400
Though Chang Wang-chi has the
mental age of an 8-year-old,

104
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:06,720
and claims he hated Cheung Siu-chung,

105
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:09,200
his reaction at the mourning hall
told a different story.

106
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:12,640
Leung Yuet-ping taught her husband
to recite those lines

107
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,080
and take the rap for her

108
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:15,920
with a seamless story.

109
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:18,480
This woman is something else.

110
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:21,760
Sze Sir, Right Sir, you asked me
to check on the taxi driver.

111
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,280
I found something.

112
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:26,400
The driver you found didn't even drive
the taxi that night.

113
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,920
That's why you got nothing from him.

114
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:30,880
The real driver's last name was Tsang.

115
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,320
He just gave his statement.

116
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,360
What did he say?

117
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:36,080
He said he drove Leung Yuet-ping
and Cheung Wang-chi

118
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:37,920
from Ko Cho Village to Wan Mei Village.

119
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,920
Cheung Wang-chi was mentally challenged

120
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,280
but married such a pretty wife.

121
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,880
That's why he remembered them well.

122
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:46,160
That means Cheung Wang-chi was there.

123
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:48,480
There's a chance he was telling the truth.

124
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:51,840
Sir, let us post bail for Chi.

125
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:54,720
He can't go to jail, he'll die.

126
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:58,200
Grandma, Dad is in custody, not jail.

127
00:06:58,400 --> 00:07:01,760
What's the difference? He's still locked up.

128
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:05,120
Oh dear, he can't be left alone.

129
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:07,360
Ms. Leung, sign here and you may go.

130
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:10,400
You tramp! Chi couldn't have killed Chung.

131
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:12,480
You taught him to take the rap for you.

132
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,000
Watch your mouth!

133
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:16,240
Chung is my son, why would I kill him?

134
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:18,480
Now that I'm carrying Chi's baby,

135
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,200
I don't want him to go to jail either.

136
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:22,640
I wish he didn't kill Chung.

137
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:25,400
But he used too much force.

138
00:07:25,520 --> 00:07:28,320
I wish I was inside at the time.

139
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,880
I could have intervened.

140
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:34,080
Leung Yuet-ping, quit your act.

141
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,920
We'll get to the bottom of this.

142
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:38,480
I really don't want to start an argument.

143
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:40,640
Sir, if there's nothing else. I'm leaving.

144
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,640
You may go.

145
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:48,200
Mrs. Cheung, this is a search warrant

146
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,520
for us to search your house.

147
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,800
After Chung died,

148
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:09,200
I saw Chi in the backyard by himself
throwing paper airplanes around.

149
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:15,360
Chung B, did you get the airplanes?

150
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:24,400
Looks like Dad put down in drawing
the times he spent with Chung.

151
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:26,040
I got it.

152
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:35,760
Is this a drawing by Chi of Chung
when he died?

153
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,560
Looks like it.

154
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:44,320
That means Leung Yuet-ping
was there when Chung died.

155
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:47,840
She had a hand in forcing the
sugarcane into Chung's mouth.

156
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,440
Look at this!

157
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:52,320
The drawing is crude

158
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:54,000
and there's nothing in the background.

159
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:56,080
It's hard to say this is
the scene of the crime.

160
00:08:56,920 --> 00:09:00,960
The woman in the drawing could be
pulling out the sugarcane

161
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:03,520
instead of forcing it in.

162
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:07,440
Though this paper airplane
can't prove anything.

163
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:10,160
Cheung Wang-chi was throwing
paper airplanes at the mourning hall

164
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,800
he was communicating with Cheung Siu-chung.

165
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:12,800
He wasn't angry with him.

166
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:14,800
But Cheung Wang-chi already admitted

167
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:17,680
he killed Cheung Siu-chung while
trying to save him.

168
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:20,000
Nothing will make a difference.

169
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:25,280
No...if we can verify
the woman in the drawing was Leung Yuet-ping

170
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:28,080
at least we're sure of one thing.

171
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:32,400
She was there when Chung died.

172
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,640
Why did she lie?

173
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,480
The most likely reason was

174
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,480
she had a hand in forcing the
sugarcane into Chung's mouth.

175
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:41,200
I know this drawing is not solid evidence,

176
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:43,840
but at least it's a lead.

177
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:45,760
That's very true, Sir...

178
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:49,440
We can ask Cheung Wang-chi about
this paper airplane.

179
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:51,120
What was he trying to draw?

180
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:53,600
Where and what happened?

181
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:58,160
I don't know.

182
00:09:58,400 --> 00:09:59,280
Dad won't say anything.

183
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,320
He doesn't know anything.

184
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:02,320
He's driving me crazy.

185
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:05,280
Chi has been brainwashed.

186
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,600
He only listens to that woman

187
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,880
and took the blame for everything.

188
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:11,600
It's hopeless.

189
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,920
Come on, Grandma. Don't worry!

190
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:17,520
There's still time before the trial.

191
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:20,240
I will find evidence to help Dad.

192
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,400
Here's $5M.

193
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:38,920
Chi listens to you.

194
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,880
Tell him to change his statement.

195
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,880
Deny he killed Chung.

196
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:46,000
Let the Police think because
he's mentally challenged

197
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,200
his statement is not believable.

198
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:50,080
They'll only charge him for
obstruction of justice.

199
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:52,800
Then the money is yours.

200
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:57,360
If that's not enough,

201
00:10:57,520 --> 00:11:01,840
I can sell my gold jewelry and dowry.

202
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:04,960
It should be worth $7M.

203
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:08,800
I know you don't care for this family.

204
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:13,200
After the baby is born, we'll raise it.

205
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:17,600
Take the money and live the life you want.

206
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:22,640
Your terms are so attractive.

207
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:27,280
As opposed to money, sincerity is
more important.

208
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:33,680
I'm willing to do anything for Chi.

209
00:11:36,280 --> 00:11:39,520
You shouldn't have done that.

210
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:42,080
I only wanted you to say "please".

211
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:46,320
Please?

212
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:52,720
Will you tell Chi to change his statement?

213
00:11:55,000 --> 00:12:00,080
I just remembered, Chi is a murder suspect.

214
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:03,440
He can only see his lawyer and no one else.

215
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:05,600
You knelt down for nothing.

216
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:09,680
You...

217
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:12,240
I'm bearing you a grandchild.

218
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:14,000
Don't scare me.

219
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:16,400
I need to rest for the baby's sake.

220
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,480
See yourself out.

221
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:23,200
You'll get retribution for this!

222
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:31,840
What a cocky tramp!

223
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:38,720
For Chi's sake, here goes nothing...

224
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:42,880
No, I killed Chung. Arrest me. Go ahead...

225
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:45,600
Mrs. Cheung, calm down and have a seat.

226
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:47,280
Just because you claimed to be the killer

227
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:48,800
doesn't mean we'll arrest you.

228
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:50,800
The Police only look at the evidence.

229
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:52,560
You're Cheung Wang-chi's mother.

230
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:54,240
Your son just pleaded guilty to murder

231
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:55,520
and you turn yourself in.

232
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:57,200
Are you taking the rap for him?

233
00:12:57,400 --> 00:12:58,640
I must remind you,

234
00:12:58,800 --> 00:13:01,440
perjury can land you in jail for ten years.

235
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:06,320
I'm old and I'm a killer.

236
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:11,200
I don't expect to come out if I go to jail.

237
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:14,240
I told you I killed Chung...

238
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:18,160
OK, tell us how exactly did you
kill Cheung Siu-chung.

239
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:20,000
Like I said before,

240
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,840
I bought sugarcane for Chung that day

241
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:24,000
and Nam drove me there.

242
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:26,160
We got into an argument.

243
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:28,560
It was more than an argument.

244
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:32,720
When I saw him eating sugarcane,

245
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:38,080
he was the spitting image
of his grandfather.

246
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:43,040
He reminded me his grandfather
left me nothing

247
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:45,280
and had an illegitimate son.

248
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:48,240
The more I looked at him,
the angrier I became

249
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:51,680
and I forced the sugarcane into his mouth.

250
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:53,200
I also scolded him

251
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:56,640
and told him to keep eating sugarcane
if he liked it so much.

252
00:13:56,800 --> 00:14:01,600
He started to back away
and he rammed into the cabinet.

253
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:06,000
Then he had a seizure

254
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:09,520
and lay very still on the floor.

255
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:12,160
He didn't move like he was dead.

256
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:16,800
I got scared and left in a hurry.

257
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:21,200
As I left, I took the new
trust fund document

258
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:22,960
and I burnt it afterwards.

259
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:27,200
Because I forced the sugarcane
inside Chung's mouth,

260
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:29,280
that's why Chung is dead.

261
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:32,080
Why did you wait this long to
turn yourself in?

262
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:39,280
Chi is taking the rap for me
because he loves me.

263
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:45,920
As a mother, I can't watch my son
go to jail.

264
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:49,040
I killed him, just arrest me.

265
00:14:49,520 --> 00:14:53,120
Cheung Siu-chung's time of death
was at 12:05a.m.

266
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,640
He died of suffocation.

267
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:58,800
Tang Heung-nam said he drove you home
after 11p.m.

268
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:02,240
Nam remembered wrong.

269
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:05,120
Maybe after I forced the sugarcane
inside his mouth,

270
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:08,480
he lingered till 12:05a.m. to die.

271
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:10,880
According to our record,

272
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:13,920
Leung Yuet-ping and Cheung Wang-chi
saw Cheung Siu-chung

273
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:18,400
half an hour after you left
the village house

274
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:19,920
and had a fight with him.

275
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:23,120
That means when you left,
Cheung Siu-chung was still alive.

276
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:27,280
Leung Yuet-ping didn't go see Chung.

277
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:30,320
Only Chi went inside.

278
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:34,480
He must have seen him lying on the floor
and thought he was dead.

279
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,960
Chi is always known to be timid.

280
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,720
He must have been too scared and left.

281
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:40,560
Why did Leung Yuet-ping lie

282
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:44,000
about fighting with Cheung Siu-chung
inside the house?

283
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:46,480
What does she stand to gain from that?

284
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:49,200
How would I know?

285
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,920
This is Tang Suk-han's statement.

286
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:55,600
She verified and signed it.

287
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:58,880
Sir, Grandma was too eager
to save her son,

288
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,240
that's why she pleaded guilty to murder.

289
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:02,000
Please don't take her seriously.

290
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:05,040
Ms. Cheung, I know the elderly's mindset.

291
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:06,400
But she pleaded guilty,

292
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:09,520
we must detain her according to procedures.

293
00:16:10,920 --> 00:16:13,040
Hello! What's this? I live here.

294
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:16,480
I need Tang Suk-han to sign for this.

295
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:20,160
(Cheung Siu-chung)

296
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:22,720
I'll do it.

297
00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:23,520
Good.

298
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:38,960
(Sent)

299
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:44,600
Hello, Di?
Hello, Siu-lai?

300
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:47,040
My boyfriend parked his car outside
your front door

301
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:49,000
from 11:30p.m. to 11:45p.m. that night.

302
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:50,200
He sent you a clip from his dash cam.

303
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,080
See if it's any help to you.

304
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:52,200
Thank you so much!

305
00:17:05,840 --> 00:17:11,120
Hello, Sze Sir? I found out
the night Chung died, at 11:40p.m.,

306
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:12,960
he bought something online.

307
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:16,160
According to my neighbor's boyfriend's
dash cam,

308
00:17:16,280 --> 00:17:20,560
you can clearly see at 11:35p.m.

309
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:23,200
Grandma got out of Brother Nam's car
and came home.

310
00:17:23,320 --> 00:17:27,440
That means after Grandma came home,
Chung was still alive.

311
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,960
Grandma couldn't have killed him.

312
00:17:32,600 --> 00:17:37,760
Grandma...

313
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:40,000
Why do you have to be so smart?

314
00:17:40,280 --> 00:17:45,880
You proved I didn't kill Chung,
how can we save Chi?

315
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:50,400
Grandma, Chung's death was tragic.

316
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:52,720
I won't let you plead guilty to
something you didn't do

317
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:55,200
or let Dad go to jail wrongfully.

318
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:59,440
That night after your fight,

319
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:01,120
Chung wasn't angry with you.

320
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:04,640
He bought you a shawl online.

321
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:09,880
This shawl could prove
after you left that night,

322
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:11,920
Chung was still alive.

323
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:15,320
Chung wouldn't want to see
this miscarriage of justice.

324
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:20,520
Here's the card Chung sent you.

325
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:27,200
Grandma, don't be mad at me.

326
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:30,880
It's bad for your health.

327
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:33,560
This is a designer shawl.

328
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:39,600
It's expensive but the quality is very good.

329
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:43,360
I know you didn't want to pay
so much for it.

330
00:18:43,520 --> 00:18:48,000
After I inherit Grandpa's estate,

331
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:53,120
I promise I'll get you whatever you like

332
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:56,880
at whatever cost.

333
00:18:57,520 --> 00:19:00,280
Grandma, I love you.

334
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:40,560
(Till We Meet Again - Reprise)

335
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:49,080
(Director's words)

336
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:00,720
Mr. Luk, thanks for giving us
this interview.

337
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:02,720
You have done so well in China
in recent years.

338
00:20:02,840 --> 00:20:05,600
I'm glad you have not forgotten
your audience in Hong Kong.

339
00:20:05,760 --> 00:20:07,360
Thank you for your time.

340
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:14,160
Ping...

341
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:22,160
You still recognize me?

342
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:24,240
You're afraid I don't recognize you,

343
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:26,120
that's why you want to run away again.

344
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:28,080
It happened last year when the play opened.

345
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:30,840
You left as soon as I saw you.

346
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,280
I was surrounded by reporters

347
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:34,120
and couldn't catch up with you.

348
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:37,920
You think...I could have forgotten you?

349
00:20:40,640 --> 00:20:43,920
This play is called Till We Meet Again.

350
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:46,280
I wrote this play

351
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:48,720
hoping you'll know how I feel

352
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:50,720
and come back to me.

353
00:20:51,800 --> 00:20:53,920
I came back for a reprise

354
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:56,640
hoping you'll come see me again.

355
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:01,120
I'm staying at the hotel next door.

356
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:05,200
If you have time,
drop by for a drink and catch up.

357
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:17,280
Thank you.

358
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:19,440
Doctor, I'm three months pregnant.

359
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:22,240
Can I have sex starting today?

360
00:21:22,360 --> 00:21:24,880
Though you are three months pregnant,

361
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:28,040
you're at an advanced maternal age
and you have high blood pressure.

362
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:30,720
Sexual activities may affect the fetus

363
00:21:30,800 --> 00:21:32,640
and endanger your life.

364
00:21:32,760 --> 00:21:33,920
I don't recommend it.

365
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:35,840
Can I have an abortion?

366
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:37,840
You're over ten weeks,

367
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:40,880
induced abortion is too risky.

368
00:21:41,040 --> 00:21:43,880
Doc, you just said the pregnancy
is dangerous for me.

369
00:21:44,040 --> 00:21:46,480
So either way is dangerous for me?

370
00:21:46,560 --> 00:21:48,280
I don't really want this baby.

371
00:21:48,360 --> 00:21:50,000
Just get rid of it for me.

372
00:22:02,040 --> 00:22:05,080
Tai-di, how was Chi today?

373
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:06,960
Too bad I couldn't visit him.

374
00:22:07,120 --> 00:22:10,280
How is he getting on in detention?

375
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:14,000
He's fine. He just won't give us
straight answers.

376
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:16,880
Did you find new evidence?

377
00:22:17,080 --> 00:22:21,680
We had to sign the papers for the probate
tomorrow afternoon.

378
00:22:21,840 --> 00:22:23,920
Then the case will go to court.

379
00:22:24,040 --> 00:22:26,040
There's not much time...

380
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:28,160
Long time no see.

381
00:22:28,800 --> 00:22:30,880
What are you doing here?

382
00:22:31,120 --> 00:22:36,480
Just checking on the house
to see what needs to be fixed.

383
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:41,560
Tai-di, I'll expand your room on the 3/F

384
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:44,160
and turn it into my gym room.

385
00:22:44,400 --> 00:22:46,240
What are you talking about?

386
00:22:46,360 --> 00:22:48,840
We're signing the papers tomorrow
at the law firm

387
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:52,000
and the house will be mine.

388
00:22:52,200 --> 00:22:54,960
I'm here to remind you,

389
00:22:55,120 --> 00:22:57,080
you must pack up and leave.

390
00:23:05,520 --> 00:23:07,040
(Till We Meet Again)

391
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:09,200
Grandma?

392
00:23:09,320 --> 00:23:11,120
Chung liked plays?

393
00:23:11,280 --> 00:23:13,800
Soon after Grandpa passed away,

394
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:19,680
Chung told me he went to see a play
with his mother for the first and only time.

395
00:23:19,840 --> 00:23:22,400
That woman never went out with Chung.

396
00:23:22,520 --> 00:23:24,640
What was the name of that play?

397
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:27,920
Till We Meet Again.

398
00:23:28,560 --> 00:23:32,040
This guy looks familiar.

399
00:23:33,120 --> 00:23:34,560
Luk Chin?

400
00:23:34,720 --> 00:23:36,160
What? Who is he?

401
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:40,600
He was that tramp's boyfriend before
she married Chi.

402
00:23:40,760 --> 00:23:42,720
An employee at the DAC said

403
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:47,360
that tramp decided to marry Chi
and pay off her debts,

404
00:23:47,560 --> 00:23:52,400
so she broke up with her loser boyfriend
who was into performing arts.

405
00:23:52,560 --> 00:23:56,160
She went to see this play because of him?

406
00:23:56,360 --> 00:24:00,400
Chung queued up for a long time and
bought expensive tickets

407
00:24:00,560 --> 00:24:03,600
as a treat for his mother.

408
00:24:03,760 --> 00:24:04,880
After he saw it,

409
00:24:05,080 --> 00:24:09,560
he told me excitedly he saw the play
from start to finish.

410
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:13,560
But that tramp only went there to see
her old flame and not the play.

411
00:24:13,720 --> 00:24:15,840
From start to finish?

412
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:19,440
No way. He was ten minutes late
for everything.

413
00:24:19,600 --> 00:24:20,880
He couldn't have seen the beginning.

414
00:24:21,120 --> 00:24:24,040
Cut your bad habit of being late.

415
00:24:24,200 --> 00:24:28,240
Or you'll give people an excuse
to use that against you, understand?

416
00:24:29,800 --> 00:24:32,160
Remember we're seeing a movie
the day after tomorrow?

417
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:33,880
Don't be late.

418
00:24:34,120 --> 00:24:37,200
Even after that time,
when I met him to see a movie,

419
00:24:37,360 --> 00:24:39,040
he was late as usual.

420
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:43,320
There's no way he was on time
when he saw the play with Leung Yuet-ping.

421
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:46,320
He wanted his mother to see the whole thing.

422
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:50,480
He found a way to make sure he was on time.

423
00:24:50,600 --> 00:24:52,960
Grandma...If I can prove something,

424
00:24:53,200 --> 00:24:55,200
there's a chance we can turn things around.

425
00:24:55,360 --> 00:24:56,280
What?

426
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:58,240
How can I help you, Miss?

427
00:24:58,400 --> 00:25:01,120
I'm the defense counsel in a murder case.

428
00:25:01,240 --> 00:25:02,960
I need you to check something for me.

429
00:25:14,800 --> 00:25:18,960
Ms. Leung, Ms. Tang, Mr. Mok will be
here on time at noon.

430
00:25:19,080 --> 00:25:20,280
Please wait.

431
00:25:22,120 --> 00:25:24,080
Ms. Cheung!
Yes!

432
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:26,400
We have what you asked for.

433
00:25:26,720 --> 00:25:28,320
Ms. Leung, Ms. Tang,

434
00:25:28,400 --> 00:25:30,960
please read carefully the details of
Mr. Cheung Siu-chung's trust fund.

435
00:25:31,080 --> 00:25:33,280
If you have no questions,
please sign your name.

436
00:25:33,440 --> 00:25:34,400
Right here?

437
00:25:36,560 --> 00:25:38,160
(Leung Yuet-ping)

438
00:25:41,960 --> 00:25:44,520
Hurry up! Stop reading!

439
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,160
Ms. Cheung!

440
00:25:46,280 --> 00:25:47,040
Thank you.

441
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:53,080
Hurry up! You're wasting Mr. Mok's time.

442
00:26:01,560 --> 00:26:02,560
Hello?

443
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:06,240
OK...I see...

444
00:26:06,360 --> 00:26:09,840
Signing your name won't get you the house.

445
00:26:10,360 --> 00:26:12,040
What do you mean?

446
00:26:14,440 --> 00:26:18,000
I checked with Chung's smart watch company.

447
00:26:18,080 --> 00:26:23,920
The Police said his heart stopped
at 12:05 a.m. on October 16.

448
00:26:24,080 --> 00:26:27,200
But that was just the time displayed
on Chung's watch.

449
00:26:27,320 --> 00:26:29,920
I just sent you a printout.

450
00:26:30,080 --> 00:26:32,600
Chung set his watch ten minutes ahead.

451
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:37,680
That means his real time of death
was 11:55 p.m. on October 15.

452
00:26:37,800 --> 00:26:40,120
The time recorded by the watch company

453
00:26:40,200 --> 00:26:42,240
in cloud storage is GMT,
Greenwich Mean Time.

454
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:45,800
In other words, when Chung died,
he was not yet 21 years old.

455
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:48,000
He was not entitled to inherit
Grandpa's estate.

456
00:26:48,120 --> 00:26:50,600
The trust fund he set up is invalid.

457
00:26:50,760 --> 00:26:54,400
Grandpa's estate will follow
the Intestates' Estates Ordinance,

458
00:26:54,520 --> 00:26:56,720
and will be divided up between
his spouse and children.

459
00:26:56,840 --> 00:26:59,880
So Grandma and Dad will each get 50%.

460
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:01,080
Impossible!

461
00:27:01,280 --> 00:27:05,120
Do you know why Chung set his watch
ten minutes early?

462
00:27:05,240 --> 00:27:08,160
He wanted to see the play with you,

463
00:27:08,320 --> 00:27:10,640
so he set the watch ten minutes early.

464
00:27:10,880 --> 00:27:13,200
Chung loved you very much,

465
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:15,600
but you didn't cherish him

466
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:17,640
or respect his last wishes.

467
00:27:17,800 --> 00:27:20,160
If you didn't force me to move out,

468
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:25,120
Tai-di and I would not have found
the tickets to the play

469
00:27:25,240 --> 00:27:28,960
and we wouldn't have known he set
his watch ten minutes early.

470
00:27:29,040 --> 00:27:34,040
You get nothing and you did it to yourself.

471
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:39,360
Mr. Mok, a picture like this
can be used as proof?

472
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:40,840
Shouldn't the Police look into it?

473
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:45,280
It'll depend on whether the court
will admit this as new evidence.

474
00:27:45,360 --> 00:27:48,160
I'm afraid you must both wait a bit longer

475
00:27:48,280 --> 00:27:51,920
to see if Cheung Siu-chung's
trust fund is valid.

476
00:27:52,520 --> 00:27:53,600
Hear that?

477
00:27:54,160 --> 00:27:56,600
I still have a shot at the house.

478
00:27:56,720 --> 00:27:59,200
I don't care. You're moving out.

479
00:27:59,560 --> 00:28:00,960
We'll see.

480
00:28:01,840 --> 00:28:04,480
Chin, I can't go to the cruise terminal
with you today.

481
00:28:04,560 --> 00:28:07,040
All the best. I'll see you in three months.

482
00:28:07,760 --> 00:28:08,720
Bye.

483
00:28:15,440 --> 00:28:20,240
Ping, an abortion at your age
is too dangerous. Don't do it.

484
00:28:21,800 --> 00:28:25,200
I was afraid you didn't want
someone else's baby.

485
00:28:25,360 --> 00:28:28,040
All because I had no money back then.

486
00:28:28,200 --> 00:28:31,320
Or you wouldn't have to marry
someone else to pay off the debts.

487
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:33,560
You have suffered long enough.

488
00:28:34,080 --> 00:28:37,640
Now that we're finally back together.

489
00:28:37,760 --> 00:28:40,320
I won't mind anything about you.

490
00:28:41,800 --> 00:28:44,600
Besides, I like kids.

491
00:28:44,880 --> 00:28:50,520
I'll raise your child like my own.

492
00:28:52,560 --> 00:28:55,840
Don't worry. Leave everything to me.

493
00:29:01,720 --> 00:29:03,520
What is it?

494
00:29:03,640 --> 00:29:08,400
Madam, a man went through your trash
last night.

495
00:29:08,520 --> 00:29:10,240
He also brought a camera

496
00:29:10,360 --> 00:29:13,640
and he asked me if you went out
with another man.

497
00:29:13,760 --> 00:29:15,360
I didn't say anything.

498
00:29:15,520 --> 00:29:17,920
You're with child, be careful.

499
00:29:18,280 --> 00:29:22,280
Would that be a private detective
hired by Tai-di?

500
00:29:22,520 --> 00:29:26,720
Oh dear! Chin spent the night here.

501
00:29:26,840 --> 00:29:28,640
What if they took pictures of us

502
00:29:28,720 --> 00:29:31,080
and show them to Chi?

503
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:34,280
Chi would know I cheated on him again

504
00:29:34,360 --> 00:29:37,560
and may tell the Police everything
in a rage.

505
00:29:39,360 --> 00:29:41,080
Chin, scrap that idea.

506
00:29:41,200 --> 00:29:42,760
Let's stick to the original plan.

507
00:29:42,840 --> 00:29:44,280
I'll meet you at the cruise terminal.

508
00:29:58,120 --> 00:30:01,120
Dad, I hired a private detective
who took pictures of

509
00:30:01,240 --> 00:30:06,040
Leung Yuet-ping sleeping with another man
behind your back.

510
00:30:06,200 --> 00:30:09,040
I also went through her trash in the hotel

511
00:30:09,120 --> 00:30:11,920
and found the receipt of an abortion.

512
00:30:12,120 --> 00:30:15,120
She got rid of your baby three months ago.

513
00:30:15,920 --> 00:30:19,560
Dad, look what she did to you and the baby!

514
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:22,040
She only wanted you to take the rap for her.

515
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:25,680
Come on, listen to me...

516
00:30:25,840 --> 00:30:28,160
How did Chung B die that night?

517
00:30:28,440 --> 00:30:31,120
Can you tell us the truth?

518
00:30:31,960 --> 00:30:34,000
Sorry, it's time for the trial.

519
00:30:34,200 --> 00:30:37,200
Understand?
Let's go, it's time.

520
00:30:45,520 --> 00:30:47,440
The trial started ten minutes ago.

521
00:30:47,760 --> 00:30:49,360
In another half an hour,

522
00:30:49,520 --> 00:30:50,960
everything will be all over.

523
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:53,360
Father...

524
00:30:53,720 --> 00:30:56,480
Why did you do something like that?

525
00:30:57,680 --> 00:30:59,120
Why did you do this to me?

526
00:31:00,360 --> 00:31:01,120
(The day before the incident)

527
00:31:01,280 --> 00:31:04,160
Chung...stay right there...

528
00:31:04,280 --> 00:31:06,400
I'll be 21 years old in two days.

529
00:31:06,600 --> 00:31:09,320
I will go home and explain my arrangements
to everyone.

530
00:31:09,480 --> 00:31:11,920
No, stay right there.
Chung, listen to me...

531
00:31:12,080 --> 00:31:14,360
I don't want to listen.
I don't want to see you again.

532
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:15,760
(The day of the incident)

533
00:31:15,840 --> 00:31:17,120
Did Chung contact you?

534
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:18,400
No.

535
00:31:18,640 --> 00:31:21,360
He'll be 21 years old tomorrow.

536
00:31:21,560 --> 00:31:23,040
You want to celebrate with him?

537
00:31:23,160 --> 00:31:24,040
Yes!

538
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:27,360
Then send him a message.

539
00:31:27,520 --> 00:31:31,600
Tell him you missed him, ask for his address

540
00:31:31,760 --> 00:31:35,360
and we'll surprise him and
celebrate with him, OK?

541
00:31:35,520 --> 00:31:36,560
Great...

542
00:31:42,000 --> 00:31:43,120
(Papa, I'm at No. 38 Wan Mei Village)
(I'll be waiting for you)

543
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:45,120
Get up...didn't you want to celebrate

544
00:31:45,280 --> 00:31:46,720
Chung's birthday with him?

545
00:31:46,840 --> 00:31:49,040
I'm very sleepy.

546
00:31:52,200 --> 00:31:54,800
It's cool, what is that?

547
00:31:54,920 --> 00:31:58,360
Hello? I need a car from Ko Cho Village
to Wan Mei Village.

548
00:32:09,680 --> 00:32:12,560
I need a car from Ko Cho Village
to Wan Mei Village.

549
00:32:13,440 --> 00:32:15,680
What's wrong? You're scratching all over.

550
00:32:15,800 --> 00:32:17,320
I feel itchy.

551
00:32:17,560 --> 00:32:20,400
Stop. Scratching will make it itchier.

552
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:24,720
Oh dear, I forgot mint will make you itchy.

553
00:32:24,800 --> 00:32:26,280
Now my leg is itchy.

554
00:32:26,360 --> 00:32:27,640
Up ahead on Man Nin Street,

555
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:29,880
get him something from the
convenience store.

556
00:32:30,200 --> 00:32:31,120
Thanks.

557
00:32:31,280 --> 00:32:32,880
Take this...

558
00:32:34,840 --> 00:32:36,120
Drink some water.

559
00:32:39,120 --> 00:32:41,640
Mom, what are you doing here?

560
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:43,840
Chung B!
Papa!

561
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:46,360
I missed you so much.

562
00:32:46,520 --> 00:32:49,840
Papa is not angry with you.

563
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:53,360
Will you come home with me?

564
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:55,600
Good...

565
00:32:55,760 --> 00:32:57,440
I don't mean to pressure you.

566
00:32:57,600 --> 00:33:00,640
I don't want Grandma in the house,

567
00:33:00,760 --> 00:33:04,080
because I have bad memories there.

568
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:06,400
I don't want to live there anymore.

569
00:33:06,480 --> 00:33:09,120
Let's sell the house,

570
00:33:09,320 --> 00:33:11,000
and buy two separate flats.

571
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,960
One for the three of us,

572
00:33:13,080 --> 00:33:15,360
the other one for Grandma.

573
00:33:15,560 --> 00:33:17,200
Won't that be better?

574
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:20,160
Good idea...

575
00:33:20,400 --> 00:33:24,760
If you don't like bad memories of the house,

576
00:33:24,880 --> 00:33:27,680
let Grandma stay there.

577
00:33:27,840 --> 00:33:32,800
We'll move to somewhere smaller, OK?

578
00:33:32,920 --> 00:33:34,960
Chung B is so smart!

579
00:33:35,040 --> 00:33:37,440
What can I say to make you understand?

580
00:33:37,640 --> 00:33:41,240
It's 12 o'clock...
Chung B, it's 12 o'clock!

581
00:33:41,360 --> 00:33:44,120
You're 21 years old...
12 o'clock already?

582
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:47,520
Happy birthday...
Thanks, Papa...

583
00:33:48,680 --> 00:33:50,960
Cheung Wang-chi, can you describe

584
00:33:51,160 --> 00:33:54,560
Cheung Siu-chung's relationship with
his mother Leung Yuet-ping?

585
00:33:54,880 --> 00:33:58,400
You can't let Grandma stay in the house.

586
00:33:58,480 --> 00:34:02,480
No, I won't abandon Grandma!

587
00:34:02,600 --> 00:34:04,400
But you will abandon me?

588
00:34:04,560 --> 00:34:08,200
I'll be home tomorrow to
explain my decision.

589
00:34:10,960 --> 00:34:13,920
Chung B, what's wrong?

590
00:34:14,360 --> 00:34:17,760
He's having a seizure.

591
00:34:17,880 --> 00:34:24,480
Papa will save you...Bite on this...

592
00:34:24,640 --> 00:34:26,680
It's after midnight, Chung is 21 years old.

593
00:34:26,840 --> 00:34:29,920
If he's dead, I can take the revised
document of the trust fund.

594
00:34:30,120 --> 00:34:31,440
Then I can get the house.

595
00:34:31,560 --> 00:34:33,440
No, don't pull it out!

596
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:34,960
He's still having a seizure.

597
00:34:35,120 --> 00:34:36,720
What now?

598
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:38,560
Stick it back in!

599
00:34:40,680 --> 00:34:42,080
He's that old geezer's son,

600
00:34:42,240 --> 00:34:44,880
I gave birth to him for the money.

601
00:34:46,200 --> 00:34:49,600
I'll get the money when he's dead.

602
00:34:58,640 --> 00:35:00,200
I must leave this place.

603
00:35:00,360 --> 00:35:02,760
I can pretend the past didn't happen.

604
00:35:03,080 --> 00:35:04,800
Chung, I can finally forget about you.

605
00:35:05,720 --> 00:35:13,160
Why would a mother abandon her baby?

606
00:35:13,920 --> 00:35:21,360
How could Honey kill the baby?

607
00:35:23,160 --> 00:35:26,200
Did she want Chung B to die?

608
00:35:26,560 --> 00:35:28,720
Chung is dead...

609
00:35:28,840 --> 00:35:31,920
How did that happen?

610
00:35:32,160 --> 00:35:36,320
I wanted to save him.

611
00:35:36,480 --> 00:35:39,840
How did I kill him?

612
00:35:39,960 --> 00:35:43,520
Chi, listen to me. You wanted to save Chung.

613
00:35:43,640 --> 00:35:46,000
You applied too much force and killed him.

614
00:35:46,080 --> 00:35:47,680
You didn't mean it.

615
00:35:47,840 --> 00:35:50,800
The Police should not put you in jail, OK?

616
00:35:50,920 --> 00:35:53,920
Don't let anyone know we saw Chung.

617
00:35:54,080 --> 00:35:56,960
Or else people would think
we're connected to Chung's death.

618
00:35:57,080 --> 00:35:58,800
Don't tell anyone.

619
00:36:00,760 --> 00:36:03,440
Listen to me, we did not see Chung.

620
00:36:03,640 --> 00:36:05,280
We did not see the revised document.

621
00:36:05,440 --> 00:36:09,720
We were asleep at home at the time, OK?

622
00:36:13,640 --> 00:36:16,240
Change into your pajamas and go to bed.

623
00:36:16,680 --> 00:36:18,480
Open the door!

624
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,000
What is it?

625
00:36:20,080 --> 00:36:21,680
Tai-di just called.

626
00:36:21,800 --> 00:36:22,960
Something bad happened to Chung.

627
00:36:23,080 --> 00:36:24,080
They're giving him emergency resuscitation.

628
00:36:24,200 --> 00:36:24,880
What?

629
00:36:24,960 --> 00:36:26,400
She wanted me to wake you.

630
00:36:26,560 --> 00:36:28,000
Chi...

631
00:36:28,120 --> 00:36:30,880
OK...I'll help him change. Go downstairs.

632
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:37,280
Chi, I'll go to the hospital.

633
00:36:37,360 --> 00:36:40,160
Go to sleep. Don't worry.

634
00:36:41,800 --> 00:36:45,600
I thought you would save Chung B,

635
00:36:46,040 --> 00:36:48,240
but you did not.

636
00:36:49,120 --> 00:36:53,520
You wanted to kill Chung B.

637
00:36:53,640 --> 00:36:56,960
You meant to...kill Chung B.

638
00:36:57,080 --> 00:36:59,440
It's OK, Grandma...

639
00:36:59,640 --> 00:37:00,480
Defendant, you need to calm down...

640
00:37:00,640 --> 00:37:02,080
Bring Leung Yuet-ping in.

641
00:37:02,520 --> 00:37:04,880
Since the defendant is currently
emotionally unstable,

642
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:07,280
the court will take a recess.

643
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:22,400
Miss, what happened?

644
00:37:22,600 --> 00:37:25,440
My stomach hurts...

645
00:37:25,520 --> 00:37:27,520
Shall I get you an ambulance?

646
00:37:28,560 --> 00:37:34,760
No, I'll just rest up a bit...

647
00:37:39,640 --> 00:37:42,400
I put up with the Cheungs for over 20 years

648
00:37:42,600 --> 00:37:44,760
for the money.

649
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:48,000
I can't turn back.

650
00:37:48,640 --> 00:37:50,880
I can't leave without the money.

651
00:38:18,160 --> 00:38:19,160
Mom!
What?

652
00:38:19,280 --> 00:38:22,480
My first medal at Sports Day...for you.

653
00:38:22,560 --> 00:38:24,880
I got my first pay cheque.

654
00:38:25,080 --> 00:38:27,160
I bought you a bracelet.

655
00:38:29,920 --> 00:38:33,840
Do you know why Chung set his watch
ten minutes early?

656
00:38:33,960 --> 00:38:36,480
He wanted to see the play with you,

657
00:38:36,600 --> 00:38:38,960
so he set the watch ten minutes early.

658
00:38:39,120 --> 00:38:42,080
Chung loved you very much,

659
00:38:42,200 --> 00:38:44,480
but you didn't cherish him.

660
00:38:55,880 --> 00:38:59,920
Dad, I don't know if you can understand me,

661
00:39:00,120 --> 00:39:04,880
Leung Yuet-ping had pre-eclampsia
and triggered an epileptic seizure.

662
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:08,560
She passed away yesterday.

663
00:39:09,760 --> 00:39:18,400
So she's dead...like Chung B?

664
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:31,640
She left us and became a star?

665
00:39:33,120 --> 00:39:36,400
We'll never see her again?

666
00:39:43,560 --> 00:39:46,200
Because new evidence has been submitted,

667
00:39:46,360 --> 00:39:49,520
the current jury is dismissed for a retrial.

668
00:39:49,640 --> 00:39:53,360
Regarding the manslaughter charge
against Cheung Wang-chi,

669
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:55,080
will the jury please give us the verdict?

670
00:39:55,160 --> 00:39:57,360
Your Honor, the verdict is unanimous.

671
00:39:57,480 --> 00:40:01,040
We find the defendant Cheung Wang-chi
not guilty of manslaughter.

672
00:40:12,040 --> 00:40:14,880
Luckily, Tai-di took care of everything.

673
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:19,920
Or I wouldn't know how to carry out
Chung's last wishes.

674
00:40:20,040 --> 00:40:21,360
Burial at sea is very simple.

675
00:40:21,480 --> 00:40:23,160
Just apply for it online.

676
00:40:23,560 --> 00:40:26,480
Chung BB...

677
00:40:26,680 --> 00:40:28,760
There is justice after all.

678
00:40:28,840 --> 00:40:31,920
Heaven took your mother
but left you with us.

679
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:33,760
Luckily the mother was rushed in
just in time,

680
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:35,120
we managed to save the baby.

681
00:40:37,160 --> 00:40:39,640
We can carry on the family line.

682
00:40:39,720 --> 00:40:44,480
Chung BB, Chung B loved to swim.

683
00:40:44,720 --> 00:40:49,840
Grandma and Tai-di are taking him
for a swim.

684
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:52,200
He should be thrilled.

685
00:41:07,320 --> 00:41:09,920
(A few months before the incident)

686
00:41:13,440 --> 00:41:19,760
A ghost!

687
00:41:19,920 --> 00:41:23,040
Stop it! That's enough!

688
00:41:23,440 --> 00:41:25,760
She's scared! Get lost!

689
00:41:29,600 --> 00:41:32,320
Miss, are you OK?

690
00:41:34,640 --> 00:41:36,000
I'm fine.

691
00:41:38,920 --> 00:41:40,200
Can you get up?

692
00:41:42,840 --> 00:41:43,880
I'll carry you.

693
00:41:43,920 --> 00:41:45,720
What?
Come on!

694
00:41:47,160 --> 00:41:49,720
Really? What's your name?

695
00:41:49,880 --> 00:41:51,360
I'm Ngai Ka-yan. And you?

696
00:41:51,560 --> 00:41:53,760
Cheung Tai-di.

697
00:41:54,040 --> 00:41:56,120
Why hasn't he called?

698
00:41:59,760 --> 00:42:01,200
What?

699
00:42:01,440 --> 00:42:03,120
Did you see the footage I sent you?

700
00:42:03,280 --> 00:42:05,040
How could you let people trick you?

701
00:42:05,240 --> 00:42:07,520
What trick? Someone scared me.

702
00:42:07,680 --> 00:42:09,520
Hurry up and take a look.

703
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:15,920
Stop it! That's enough!

704
00:42:16,480 --> 00:42:17,600
She's scared!

705
00:42:20,960 --> 00:42:22,640
(Middle-aged woman in heat)

706
00:42:22,720 --> 00:42:26,120
What the hell? How could they do this?

707
00:42:26,240 --> 00:42:28,320
What bloody show is this?

708
00:42:28,400 --> 00:42:30,000
J Weekly?!
